[01:04.36] A face in stone, decayed by age
[01:14.06] A man who has returned to tell of his damnation
[01:24.35] Fears so deep, the mouth open wide
[01:34.81] The scream died away before dawn of this time
[01:55.37] Ancient times legends
[01:59.42] Stories so dark
[02:05.09] Blackened his sight
[02:10.13] Now, not even the memories are left
[02:15.93] Back after such a long time
[02:20.27] The stone is cold as death
[02:25.29] But what formed it's true fears
[02:31.10] Only the wind is able to tell...
[03:23.41] Tell me! What did you see there?
[03:32.12] In the darkness - the darkness of the past
[04:08.22] The eyes stares so empty
[04:12.70] The mouth screams so silent
[04:24.19] Tell me! What did you see there?
[04:33.37] In the darkness - the darkness of your past.
[04:47.77] 